          "type": "number",
          "label": "x₂ =",
          "answer": -8,
          "tolerance": 0.1
        }
      ],
      "plus_minus": true,
      "hint": "Set f(x)=0. |x+2| = 6 gives two answers.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Parent: y = |x| (absolute value — V shape).",
        "Transformations: left 2, stretch ×4, reflect over x-axis, up 24.",
        "x-intercepts: 0 = -4|x+2| + 24 → |x+2| = 6.",
        "x + 2 = 6 → x = 4, or x + 2 = -6 → x = -8."
      ],
      "feedback_correct": "🔥 Absolute value. Both intercepts.",
      "feedback_wrong_parent": "The | | symbols mean absolute value."
    },
