        "2^(4x-4) = 2³ → 4x - 4 = 3.",
        "4x = 7 → x = 7/4 = 1.75.",
        "Check: 16^(0.75) = (2⁴)^(0.75) = 2³ = 8 ✓"
      ],
      "feedback_correct": "🔥 Common base. Smooth.",
      "feedback_wrong": "Both 16 and 8 are powers of 2."
