        "1.5^(t/10) = 3.375.",
        "3.375 = 1.5³, so t/10 = 3.",
        "t = 30 years.",
        "Check: 5000 · 1.5³ = 5000 · 3.375 = 16875 ✓"
      ],
      "feedback_correct": "🔥 30 years. Exponential growth.",
